repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106919","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106919.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106919.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-18T23:29:52Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102431\r\n\r\nFixes hovering to show tooltip when over the end of the last character of a symbol (where clicking would place the caret at the end). \r\nThis should be useful for cases like https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11365 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102380, since selecting the entire word puts the caret at the last character.\r\n\r\nUnifies the word detection behavior to the one that the rest of the TextEdit uses.\r\nThis fixes hovering to show tooltip not working correctly when next to unicode word break characters. Custom word separators are now respected too.\r\nRemoved the old word detection function.\r\n\r\nMoves the string detection logic to use CodeEdit's delimiter system. Though this means it won't work in comments anymore.\r\n\r\nAlso made the tooltip hover work when text is selected. There shouldn't be any problem with allowing this, since the tooltip doesn't show if mouse buttons are held. Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/12492\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht